# REST Client / JetBrains HTTP examples against the Functions emulator.
# Get a token: POST to the Auth emulator (first request), copy idToken into @token.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:5001/demo-guesthouse/asia-south1/api/v1
@auth = http://127.0.0.1:9099/identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1
@token = paste-id-token-here

### Sign in (Auth emulator)
POST {{auth}}/accounts:signInWithPassword?key=fake-api-key
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "guest@guesthouse.test", "password": "demo1234!", "returnSecureToken": true }

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Me
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Availability
GET {{base}}/availability?checkIn=2026-11-10&checkOut=2026-11-12&roomTypeId=std
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Book by type
POST {{base}}/bookings/by-type
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-booking-0001

{ "roomTypeId": "std", "checkIn": "2026-11-10", "checkOut": "2026-11-12" }

### Create payment order
POST {{base}}/payments/order
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookingId": "BOOKING_ID" }

### Verify payment (fields from Razorpay Checkout handler)
POST {{base}}/payments/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "razorpay_order_id": "order_x", "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_x", "razorpay_signature": "sig" }

### Cancel
POST {{base}}/bookings/BOOKING_ID/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "plans changed" }

### Join queue
POST {{base}}/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomTypeId": "ste", "checkIn": "2026-11-10", "checkOut": "2026-11-11" }

### My dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: run a job now (admin token)
POST {{base}}/admin/jobs/processQueue/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
